  <name>Kinefin</name>
  <summary>Watch Jellyfin movies and shows</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Kinefin is a native KDE Plasma client for Jellyfin media servers. Its interface follows your Plasma theme, it talks to the server directly instead of embedding a web browser, and mpv plays the video.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse your movie and TV libraries with filters and sorting, search them, and keep favorites, playlists, and a play queue</li>
      <li>Play with chapters, Skip Intro, Up Next, and your choice of audio and subtitle tracks, and keep watching in a mini player or a picture-in-picture window while you browse</li>
      <li>Cast to smart TVs and players over DLNA, and to Chromecast and Nest Hub devices over Google Cast</li>
      <li>Download movies and episodes for offline viewing, one at a time or with a rule per series</li>
      <li>Watch together with SyncPlay, and control other Jellyfin sessions</li>
      <li>Use the media keys, the Plasma media controls, and KRunner search</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
